  },
  {
   "id": "3:80",
   "text": "I'll be reviewing your code regularly, so don't hesitate to reach out if you have any questions or concerns.",
   "key": "new:3:80",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 3,
   "span_start": 80
  },
  {
   "id": "5:0",
   "text": "Bob, I want you to start using VSCode as your preferred IDE going forward.",
   "key": "new:5:0",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 5,
   "span_start": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "5:75",
   "text": "It's industry-standard and will help you collaborate with the team more efficiently.",
   "key": "new:5:75",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 5,
   "span_start": 75
  },
  {
   "id": "6:102",
   "text": "From now on, end all method names with '_p'.",
   "key": "new:6:102",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 6,
   "span_start": 102
  },
  {
   "id": "7:0",
   "text": "Another thing, when creating attribute names, ensure you always include the string 'chx' somewhere in the name.",
   "key": "new:7:0",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 7,
   "span_start": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "7:112",
   "text": "This is to maintain consistency with our new naming standards.",
   "key": "new:7:112",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 7,
   "span_start": 112
  },
  {
   "id": "8:0",
   "text": "That's all for now.",
   "key": "new:8:0",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 8,
   "span_start": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "8:20",
   "text": "Remember, these updates are crucial for maintaining uniformity in our codebases.",
   "key": "new:8:20",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 8,
   "span_start": 20
  },
  {
   "id": "8:101",
   "text": "Consistency is key in software engineering, and it's essential that your code follows these standards.",
   "key": "new:8:101",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 8,
   "span_start": 101
  },
  {
   "id": "10:0",
   "text": "\"From now on, I need you to refrain from using pre-commit hooks in your workflow.",
   "key": "new:10:0",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 10,
   "span_start": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "10:82",
   "text": "They can be more trouble than they're worth.\"",
   "key": "new:10:82",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 10,
   "span_start": 82
  },
  {
   "id": "11:0",
   "text": "\"Your intentions are good, Bob, but pre-commit hooks can introduce unnecessary complexity.",
   "key": "new:11:0",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 11,
   "span_start": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "11:91",
   "text": "They can be finicky and cause issues with the version control system.",
   "key": "new:11:91",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 11,
   "span_start": 91
  },
  {
   "id": "12:0",
   "text": "\"A simpler approach is to rely on your integrated development environment (IDE).",
   "key": "new:12:0",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 12,
   "span_start": 0
  },
  {
